<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ FULL RESULTS FOR 1996.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ FULL RESULTS FOR 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swarzedz final results for the</p>
<p>year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating loss			25.24   vs   13.29 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			  53.86   vs    3.00 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				53.86   vs    1.19 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Swarzedzkie Fabryki Mebli SA.</p>
<p>Earlier company reported its net loss at 39.5 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales			    106.89   vs  101.30</p>
<p>    costs of sales			90.56   vs   74.68</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.11   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.00   vs    1.81</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   2.50   vs    1.01</p>
<p>    financial costs		     31.33   vs   11.50</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
